<% if @character.approved? %>
Good news: staff approved <%= @character.name %>. They can join <%= term(:scene, count: 2).downcase %> now.
<% else %>
Staff returned <%= @character.name %>'s application with a note:

<%= @character.review_note %>

Make the changes, then submit again.
<% end %>

<%= character_url(@character) %>

